{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeLinkComponentTokensProvider\/colors","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"colors","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract30AllColorSemanticTokensProviderP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"colors","externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B32ThemeLinkComponentTokensProviderC6colors0A8Contract016AllColorSemanticfG0_pvp"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemelinkcomponenttokensprovider\/colors"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider of color semantic tokens to use for link colors"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeLinkComponentTokensProvider"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"colors","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/AllColorSemanticTokensProvider","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract30AllColorSemanticTokensProviderP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeLinkComponentTokensProvider":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeLinkComponentTokensProvider"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeLinkComponentTokensProvider","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of links"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"link"}]},{"type":"text","text":" objects like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSLink"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllLinkComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeLinkComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LinkComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"links"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Link"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with raw and semantic tokens of sizes (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"colors (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"), spaces (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and dimensions (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllDimensionSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeLinkComponentTokensProvider"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"OrangeThemeLinkComponentTokensProvider","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemelinkcomponenttokensprovider"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeLinkComponentTokensProvider/colors":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeLinkComponentTokensProvider\/colors","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider of color semantic tokens to use for link colors"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"colors"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract30AllColorSemanticTokensProviderP","text":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemelinkcomponenttokensprovider\/colors","kind":"symbol","title":"colors"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example."}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"Theme Orange","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/documentation/OUDSThemesContract/AllColorSemanticTokensProvider":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/AllColorSemanticTokensProvider","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/allcolorsemantictokensprovider","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Something which provides all semantic tokens of colors"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"}],"title":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"},"ic_theme_orange.png":{"alt":null,"type":"image","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]}}}